cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the dataset it produces, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Global MODIS snow phenology, water years 2015-2025"
authors:
  - given-names: Eric
    family-names: Gagliano
    email: egagli@uw.edu
    affiliation: University of Washington
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4362-6260"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21783366
    description: "Published dataset (Zarr archive) on Zenodo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/egagli/MODIS_snow_phenology"
url: "https://egagli.github.io/MODIS_snow_phenology/"
abstract: >-
  Global 500 m snow phenology dataset derived from the MODIS MOD10A2 Version 61
  8-day maximum snow extent product for water years 2015-2025. Provides snow
  appearance date, snow disappearance date, and the length of the longest
  continuous snow-covered period per pixel per water year, as day of water year.
keywords:
  - snow
  - snow cover
  - snow phenology
  - snow appearance date
  - snow disappearance date
  - MODIS
  - MOD10A2
  - remote sensing
  - hydrology
  - cryosphere
  - zarr
